Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:03:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add ibexdemo-cosim machine and Verilator MMIO bridge

Forward GPIO at 0x80000000 to a Unix socket server, add 128KiB RAM for demo
ELF compatibility, and relax mkvenv when pip is available without ensurepip.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
